post_install() {
  cat <<'EOF'
omarchy-kali-vm installs package-owned launchers, icons, documentation, and optional Omarchy integration helpers.

Optional Omarchy integration:
  - omarchy-kali-vm-integrate-os
    Adds Hyprland window rules for a smoother remote-viewer experience
    and installs fuller Omarchy menu integration for install/remove.
  - omarchy-kali-vm-unintegrate-os
    Removes only the user-level integration added by this package.

Cleanup is intentionally split:
  - Remove the package: pacman -R omarchy-kali-vm
  - Remove Kali VM data: omarchy-kali-vm remove
  - Remove Omarchy integration: omarchy-kali-vm-unintegrate-os
EOF
}

post_upgrade() {
  post_install
}

pre_remove() {
  cat <<'EOF'
omarchy-kali-vm removes package-owned files only.

Before this package is removed, run these if you want full cleanup:
  - Remove Kali VM data: omarchy-kali-vm remove
  - Remove Omarchy integration: omarchy-kali-vm-unintegrate-os
EOF
}
